Z||000003||fierosound||02-09-2000||02:32 AM||||This is my car - a 1987 Fiero GT V6 5-speed in Burgundy/Grey<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierosound/images/a-front.jpg">  <P>This car's stereo system was not built specifically for Stereo Competitions, but it was just a "stereo upgrade" that got out of hand.  It now sounds perfect in my opinion, better than most good home stereo systems. The trophies are just a few of the 14 I've won, (competed in 15 events).  Some came along after this photo.<P>For more info on my stereo system, check out my website:<P> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierosound" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierosound</A> <P><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 02-09-2000).]||||reg||10
