Z||000010||Oreif||02-09-2000||03:18 PM||||The fog lights are actually mounted on the frame. The lens housing extends to the front fascia and just the lens frame and the lens touch it. They are 85W focused driving lights. I don't remember the brand name but they were bought through Pep Boys auto parts.<BR>I have the relay for them wired to the parking/side marker lights so they only come on with the parking lights and a switch on the dash. Both have to be on for the lights to come on Just like fog/driving lamps on new cars. ||||reg||1
