Z||000016||william_thorniii||02-09-2000||09:40 PM||||loafer & 56,<P>That "SUV show" behind the 85 GT looks to be a Land Rover dealership to me.  If you look closely you can easily see that they are mostly Discoveries and a few Defenders.<P>In my earlier years, I termed myself "fastback whore".  I always preferred fastback designs over those that were not.  Furthermore every car that I had ever seen with a fastback model and an alternative I had preferred the fastback.  Then came my affection with the Fiero.  While the fastback looks more exotic, the notchback looks much more mean and aggressive to me.  <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
